@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@adminToken = {{$processEnv ADMIN_API_TOKEN}}
@demoPassword = {{$processEnv DEMO_PASSWORD}}

### Inicie com SEED_DEMO=1 e DEMO_PASSWORD definida. Somente dados sintéticos.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usr": "Aluno Teste",
  "eml": "new@example.test",
  "pwd": "{{demoPassword}}",
  "c_id": 2,
  "card": "4000000000000000"
}

### Pagamento recusado: 400, sem novos registros
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usr": "Aluno Recusado",
  "eml": "denied@example.test",
  "pwd": "{{demoPassword}}",
  "c_id": 1,
  "card": "5000000000000000"
}

### Relatório financeiro: credencial administrativa obrigatória
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/financial-report
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Usuário demo possui matrícula: retorna 409 e preserva histórico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
